<title>AUSTRALIA: Australia Oct car registrations fall 5.8 pct.</title>
<headline>Australia Oct car registrations fall 5.8 pct.</headline>
<dateline>CANBERRA 1996-11-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australian new motor vehicle registrations fell a seasonally-adjusted 5.8 percent in October to 51,182, the Australian Bureau of Statistics said.</p>
<p>Economists median forecast had been for a fall of around 0.5 percent.</p>
</text>
